msgctxt "200"
msgid "Phew... hah... (How can somebody that fat be so fast...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "(I guess I'll have to head back to the yakiniku place...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "He got away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"Well, don't worry about it. Thanks for trying.\r\n"
"Next time he comes, I'll make sure he pays."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Hah... hah... urgh... How'd you catch me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "You're the dine-and-dasher, right? You're coming with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Fifteen plates of grade A kalbi! That'll be 40,500 yen. Now, pay up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Man... Okay, here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Huh? You had the cash all this time? Then... why didn't you just pay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "You mean, why did I dine and dash? Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "For the most part..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "I did it for the thrill."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Get the hell outta here! And I better not see you in my shop ever again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "I'm getting hungry from all this running. I've had enough meat today, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Where else can I get away with this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "I can't believe this guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for catching him. You must be exhausted. Try drinking "
"this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "You got a <Color:8>Staminan Royale<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

